<br><HTML>Clunch, Laarseux, Eldaronmyth and myself all went into Soluseks eye tocheck it out, we were bored.  Got in there, and all seemed fien an dandy.. til all the spawns started kicking in, aggroing.. running out of mana, trap doro in floor!!!  ACK!  Chaos.  Clunch gets gang-raped by goblins, Laars FD's, Eldaronmyth and I trained 30 goblins to entrance, I took a wrong turn at Albequerue and jumped into lava, Eldaronmyth took many wrong turns and got eaten off in some mystical chasm.<br>
<br>
It took us 2 hours or so to get all the corpses back, with help of a GM (lava), Laars' FD corpse retrieval company, A necro sumon corpse spell for Clunch, and some bored lvl 52 warrior.<br>
<br>
Needless to say, it kinda sucked.<br>
<br>
-Jiggs</HTML></font></tt><p>
