Date:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;03-21-01 14:26<br>
<br><HTML>yep that about sums it up .. all but one thing .. when all the spawns came up we were in deep .. that was about an hour after wondering around seeing the sites and killing things here and there.  Peiceing it all together now I think what happened was there was another adventuring group in there with us .. who aggroed pretty much all the nasties in there on them then either died or zoned because the next thing we heard was Laarseux saying something about a possible train .. he runs into the run where we are .. some goblin wizard cast a spell at clunch which knocks him back into a trapfloor .. so down he went into a pit of some kind .. laarseux is fighting and taking some of the gobs down .. jigs and I casting spells .. until we see its hopeless .. then clunch says something is down there in the pit with him killing him .. so i sit down to med getting ready to group port us all out .. jigs charms everything that he can and starts praying that I can build up enough mana to port before the charm wears off .. laarseux jumps down the pit to help clunch .. at the time I gather enough mana for the port the charm wears off .. jigs and I jump down where clunch and laarseux are .. clunch dies almost at the same time I hit the ground .. laarseux feighs death .. and all the gobs, lava elements and god only knows what else turn around and grin at jigs and I ... this is when I releive myself of all bowel movements and took off one way,   jigs took off the other way .. some how jigs got ahead of me in all of the twisting turns and such of this place .. the only way I knew that was because when he took his flying leap into the lava .. all the lovely mobs that we're chasing him then came after me .. and there is no better feeling then when you have an entire zone of mobs aggro'ed on you.  <br>
<p>
Anyway .. you know the rest .. <br>
<p>
~ El ~</HTML></font></tt><p>
